  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "0c75b446-ad57-4c4f-8484-808de20735a4",
    "name": "Marketplace Promotions API",
    "description": "The Promotions API allows you to create, read and delete promotions of an Uber Eats storefront. Full documentation is available [here](https://developer.uber.com/docs/eats/references/api/promotions_suite).\n\n## Before you start\n\n1. Make sure you have the **Uber Eats Marketplace API** Environment selected\n2. Fill the `uber_api_client_id`, `uber_api_client_secret`, and `store_id` variables.\n3. Click on the Authorization tab of this collection\n4. Scroll down and click Get Access Token\n5. After the token is generated successfully, click on Use Token",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52001179",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/29024134-0c75b446-ad57-4c4f-8484-808de20735a4?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create Store Promotion - FLATOFF",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "tests[\"Successful Request\"] = responseCode.code === 200",
              "",
              "var jsonData = JSON.parse(responseBody);",
              "tests[\"Response contains 'promotion_id'\"] = jsonData.hasOwnProperty(\"promotion_id\");",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"promotion_id\", jsonData.promotion_id);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "User-Agent",
            "value": "Postman/UberEatsMarketplaceCollections",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"start_time\": \"2024-01-25T10:00:00-06:00\",\n    \"end_time\": \"2024-01-30T10:00:00-06:00\",\n    \"user_group\": \"ALL_CUSTOMERS\",\n    \"budget\": {\n        \"unlimited_budget\": true\n    },\n    \"external_promotion_id\":\"test_promo\",\n    \"promo_type\": \"FLATOFF\",\n    \"flat_off_discount\": {\n        \"min_basket_constraint\": {\n            \"min_spend\": {\n                \"amount\": 1000\n            }\n        },\n        \"discount_value\": {\n            \"amount\": 400\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/delivery/stores/{{store_id}}/promotion",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "delivery",
            "stores",
            "{{store_id}}",
            "promotion"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Creates a Flatoff promotion for the given store with a minimum basket spend. The discount_value amount cannot be higher than 40% of minimum order spend amount.\n\nIf you run this request succesfully, the `promotion_id` in the response body will be saved in the corresponding environment variable."
      },
